WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:16.984
"Soon it will be spring," said Dad.

2
00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:20.263
"We can plant seeds in the garden."

3
00:00:20.264 --> 00:00:23.710
"Yeah," said Oliver.

4
00:00:23.711 --> 00:00:27.905
"I'll plant corn!"

5
00:00:27.906 --> 00:00:32.261
Harry laughed.

6
00:00:32.262 --> 00:00:36.359
"Corn grows really big," said Harry.

7
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.799
"And you are really small."

8
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.757
Oliver frowned.

9
00:00:42.758 --> 00:00:46.874
"I'll grow big," said Oliver.

10
00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:50.399
"Yes," said Mom.

11
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:57.338
"You just need time to grow."

12
00:00:57.339 --> 00:00:59.935
Spring came.

13
00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:03.216
Everybody went to the garden.

14
00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:10.635
"I'll make rows for the seeds," said Dad.

15
00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:14.991
Dad made three rows.

16
00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:19.535
Oliver planted corn in row one.

17
00:01:19.536 --> 00:01:23.183
He covered the seeds with soil.

18
00:01:23.184 --> 00:01:29.663
Harry planted beans in row two.

19
00:01:29.664 --> 00:01:34.183
Emmy planted carrots in row three.

20
00:01:34.184 --> 00:01:41.383
Mom watered all the rows.

21
00:01:41.384 --> 00:01:46.150
A week later the kids ran to the garden.

22
00:01:46.151 --> 00:01:48.573
"Look!" said Harry.

23
00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:52.005
"The beans grew!"

24
00:01:52.006 --> 00:01:57.808
"The carrots grew!" said Emmy.

25
00:01:57.809 --> 00:02:00.765
Oliver looked sad.

26
00:02:00.766 --> 00:02:05.818
"The corn didn't grow," he said.

27
00:02:05.819 --> 00:02:08.443
"Don't worry," said Mom.

28
00:02:08.444 --> 00:02:12.362
"The corn will grow."

29
00:02:12.363 --> 00:02:16.620
The next week everybody ran to the garden.

30
00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:20.731
"The beans are big!" said Harry.

31
00:02:20.732 --> 00:02:26.048
"The carrots are big!" said Emmy.

32
00:02:26.049 --> 00:02:29.237
Oliver looked worried.

33
00:02:29.238 --> 00:02:34.832
"The corn didn't grow," he said.

34
00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:39.750
"It will grow," said Mom.

35
00:02:39.751 --> 00:02:44.048
The next week the corn was big!

36
00:02:44.049 --> 00:02:47.308
"Yeah!" said Oliver.

37
00:02:47.309 --> 00:02:50.668
"The corn grew a lot!"

38
00:02:50.669 --> 00:02:53.395
Harry laughed.

39
00:02:53.396 --> 00:02:56.167
"But you're still small!"

40
00:02:56.168 --> 00:03:07.700
"No, I'm not," said Oliver.

41
00:03:07.701 --> 00:03:19.773
"Look! I grew too!"
